{
  "chain": {
    "proposed": 16,
    "verifier_accept": 11,
    "kept": 10,
    "cross_passage": 0,
    "texts": [
      {
        "id": "v53_00-c1",
        "text": "After secondary education, students enroll in schools or junior colleges with higher secondary facilities.",
        "value_type": "SEMANTIC_ABSTRACTION",
        "passages": [
          "chunk-71cd4c22aa403bdbbfe9652bebaa8a32"
        ],
        "entities": [
          "entity-c8a2c0545dc6e3a41a98cc45fb89c1d1",
          "entity-7ef21215774bd670134e635868a42cbc"
        ],
        "cross_passage": false,
        "role": "v53_00"
      },
      {
        "id": "v53_00-c2",
        "text": "Greek surnames are static in mainland Greece, while middle-name patronymic usage remains dynamic.",
        "value_type": "SEMANTIC_ABSTRACTION",
        "passages": [
          "chunk-3d55bd5399bacbeebbfb1ec4fbe25c05"
        ],
        "entities": [
          "entity-f6d6b949ddbc8d8d74f3dd846eabdaad",
          "entity-b3849d27a224bb13326134e019d1efc4"
        ],
        "cross_passage": false,
        "role": "v53_00"
      },
      {
        "id": "v53_00-c3",
        "text": "Greek surnames supplanted the ancient tradition of using the father's name.",
        "value_type": "SEMANTIC_ABSTRACTION",
        "passages": [
          "chunk-3d55bd5399bacbeebbfb1ec4fbe25c05"
        ],
        "entities": [
          "entity-f39d163e053350feba5ad87d2686b8b5",
          "entity-b70a38a9f82cbc6b766a08c0ccc3d9de"
        ],
        "cross_passage": false,
        "role": "v53_00"
      },
      {
        "id": "v53_01-c2",
        "text": "The Australian Capital Territory transfer preceded Canberra's naming as national capital.",
        "value_type": "SEMANTIC_ABSTRACTION",
        "passages": [
          "chunk-9d7d1d0ba6e55fc44634c8b002385912"
        ],
        "entities": [
          "entity-e2bc55c40c8e335d87f6fefebe16f21b",
          "entity-b36459faf50ee2374b4fa8e37d3a76b6"
        ],
        "cross_passage": false,
        "role": "v53_01"
      },
      {
        "id": "v53_02-c1",
        "text": "Siim Kallas had previously been uninvolved in politics.",
        "value_type": "EXTRACTION_REPAIR",
        "passages": [
          "chunk-c42d87d5f4a98f330d69805bf509c890"
        ],
        "entities": [
          "entity-8773d7cb2ef8a6e4b49d585ca8088eb3"
        ],
        "cross_passage": false,
        "role": "v53_02"
      },
      {
        "id": "v53_02-c2",
        "text": "Andris Bērziņš was nominated two days before the nomination deadline.",
        "value_type": "EXTRACTION_REPAIR",
        "passages": [
          "chunk-b4d60fe460691ba03ad83c18b248456e"
        ],
        "entities": [
          "entity-c75424016ccbc663142680258e912155",
          "entity-69b7b21c53544237ab53bcd5446421e8"
        ],
        "cross_passage": false,
        "role": "v53_02"
      },
      {
        "id": "v53_03-c1",
        "text": "USB 3.0 high-power devices may draw at most six unit loads.",
        "value_type": "EXTRACTION_REPAIR",
        "passages": [
          "chunk-e46a1203dbcbc2aa7d6fb7bb0abe3dea"
        ],
        "entities": [
          "entity-027b5008a95847d369b8c210c057dc9a",
          "entity-35506ed38a10e1b9cdf4764846187810",
          "entity-5f220e8f3871d0956b658509dcafb08e"
        ],
        "cross_passage": false,
        "role": "v53_03"
      },
      {
        "id": "v53_03-c2",
        "text": "USB 2.0 high-power devices may draw at most five unit loads.",
        "value_type": "EXTRACTION_REPAIR",
        "passages": [
          "chunk-e46a1203dbcbc2aa7d6fb7bb0abe3dea"
        ],
        "entities": [
          "entity-b194390549d94901d3579b308fc8bd7e",
          "entity-35506ed38a10e1b9cdf4764846187810",
          "entity-0fdfab6b9ab643daaab826bd99df60d4"
        ],
        "cross_passage": false,
        "role": "v53_03"
      },
      {
        "id": "v53_04-c1",
        "text": "Alex Vreeke was trapped inside Jumanji for 20 years.",
        "value_type": "EXTRACTION_REPAIR",
        "passages": [
          "chunk-df987a543dd7e90ab1e535a77f8965fb"
        ],
        "entities": [
          "entity-cc067180f1bca331b516fdc94ad90e9e",
          "entity-56c7461350145e4584bd78f9b14cf917"
        ],
        "cross_passage": false,
        "role": "v53_04"
      },
      {
        "id": "v53_05-c3",
        "text": "Minimal-profit Bible sales and donations enable Holman Bible Outreach International to give Bibles to people unable to afford them.",
        "value_type": "SEMANTIC_ABSTRACTION",
        "passages": [
          "chunk-22cdfe585380b9bb5eb5bbaba4adadf6"
        ],
        "entities": [
          "entity-570c532207a3015cd3ef1fb4925db542",
          "entity-a467efd3783f136e77d04c51e782bd2c",
          "entity-e975b895c6141126dec4e745fd0ac022",
          "entity-c83c4069411aab67a9f63acb35797d55"
        ],
        "cross_passage": false,
        "role": "v53_05"
      }
    ]
  },
  "struct": {
    "proposed": 4,
    "verifier_accept": 3,
    "kept": 3,
    "cross_passage": 0,
    "texts": [
      {
        "id": "v53_02-g1",
        "text": "The election included a candidate distinct from the former prime minister associated with Latvian Way.",
        "value_type": "SEMANTIC_ABSTRACTION",
        "passages": [
          "chunk-b4d60fe460691ba03ad83c18b248456e"
        ],
        "entities": [
          "entity-658ea35838a9e05050df2c3919a0af52",
          "entity-d620d2f02026a6000356f1adf6811dbe"
        ],
        "cross_passage": false,
        "role": "v53_02"
      },
      {
        "id": "v53_04-g1",
        "text": "Colin Hanks portrays adult Alex Vreeke, whose avatar is Jefferson McDonough.",
        "value_type": "SEMANTIC_ABSTRACTION",
        "passages": [
          "chunk-9635e26db187b5fc88ce4cb87d79a8cd"
        ],
        "entities": [
          "entity-b82b34c6d9575477c5909318d40403e2",
          "entity-b8a7dfc57aee83e54415dd0fbc7d8fe2"
        ],
        "cross_passage": false,
        "role": "v53_04"
      },
      {
        "id": "v53_04-g2",
        "text": "Jefferson McDonough appears in Jumanji: Welcome to the Jungle through Nick Jonas's portrayal.",
        "value_type": "SEMANTIC_ABSTRACTION",
        "passages": [
          "chunk-9635e26db187b5fc88ce4cb87d79a8cd"
        ],
        "entities": [
